{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1191868-how-do-you-create-powered-items-in-aeon","id":1191868,"title":"How do you create Powered Items in Aeon?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-05T02:01:01-08:00","id":1191868,"title":"How do you create Powered Items in Aeon?","content":"So, if I wanted to create a Psion who built lots of cool Bio-apps, what skills should I take? Technology? Medicine?<br /> <br /> Which Aptitude should I go for? Vitakinesis? Biokinesis?<br /> <br /> Is it going to be a problem if I try to build a Rank 5 item that fully unlocks a second aptitude or some other workaround that basically grants the same thing? Is that just hugely broken or can it work?<br /> <br /> For hard tech, what aptitude would be best? Electrokinesis? Telekinesis? Quantakinesis?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-05T03:19:39-08:00","id":1191873,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1191868-how-do-you-create-powered-items-in-aeon#post1191868\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, if I wanted to create a Psion who built lots of cool Bio-apps, what skills should I take? Technology? Medicine?</div> </div> </div> </div>I believe the rules were cut from AEon for space, and are likely to appear in either the AEon AExpansion, or an early supplement.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1191868-how-do-you-create-powered-items-in-aeon#post1191868\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it going to be a problem if I try to build a Rank 5 item that fully unlocks a second aptitude or some other workaround that basically grants the same thing? Is that just hugely broken or can it work?</div> </div> </div> </div>Hugely broken in the main Continuum universe. The existing Prometheus Chambers are Rank 6+ items that are beyond the understanding of teams of the best human minds right now. They\u2019re built to not allow the kind of manipulation you\u2019re suggesting. Building something more powerful that could overcome these limitations would be an entire campaign in itself.<br /> <br /> But do what you want for your own splinter universe.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-05T16:18:31-08:00","id":1192081,"title":"","content":"What about something that mimicked a specific power? Like, say, a bio environment suit or shifting armor that could mimic the Gross Manipulation Transmogrify power and perhaps a couple of extras, like a concealed biolaser built into the arm? What if it could also perform Transformation? What if it had an advanced biocomp and skilled Agent, that gave you an Enhancement when performing mixed actions, like a limited version of the Imbue Instinct power?<br /> <br /> Is there room for that sort of thing or what?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-06T01:38:48-08:00","id":1192177,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1191868-how-do-you-create-powered-items-in-aeon?p=1192081#post1192081\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What about something that mimicked a specific power?</div> </div> </div> </div>(Caveat: Noetic super science will be covered in a supplement. Maybe the AEon AExpansion - I\u2019d need to remind myself just how much got included in that. Anything I say below is just my thoughts, based on the design principles we\u2019ve used so far. The final word is whatever ends up being published, and I may end up being entirely wrong in hindsight. Take it in good faith.)<br /> <br /> A specific power? Probably not. A specific effect from a specific power? Probably.<br /> <br /> For example, a suit couldn\u2019t mimic the breadth of Gross Manipulation, but might be able to transform into armour with a specific set of tags, or grow a specific set of limbs to help with climbing. But unlikely to be both.<br /> <br /> Take a look at the Equipment chapter. The bioware in there tends to follow this logic - only copying a single effect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-06T09:39:23-08:00","id":1192293,"title":"","content":"Ah, got it. And I went back to the KS page and checked and Noetic Gear was listed as going in the supplement. I hope a bit about how to use the core \u201csuper science\u201d rules to interact with and create Noetic bioware will be included as well.<br /> <br /> At minimum, it would be nice to get some examples of the different categories. Because I was kind of assuming that \u201cstandard bio-app\u201d type things were, at best, Advanced Devices, and that Powered Devices would be significantly more powerful. <br /> <br /> Thanks for talking over this with me and helping me dial in on what sort of power-level I should be looking for here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":226,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","user":"BrilliantRain","date":". 03-06-2018, 12:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}